Execute Phase 3 of the Indian Equity Research Intelligence Terminal in strict accordance with [Phases.md](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/Phases.md), [PRD.md](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/PRD.md), [Architecture.md](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/Architecture.md), and [Rules.md](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/Rules.md).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Phase 3 Scope (Ingestion & Evidence Intake Only)**:
> - Multi-format ingestion: PDF, PNG, JPG, JPEG, WebP, TXT, CSV with strict validation and rejection of unsafe/unsupported files.
> - Stable Document Identity & Provenance metadata (`document_id`, `file_hash`, `source`, `reporting_period`, `provenanceSourceType`).
> - Deterministic Document Classifier (Annual Report, Financial Statements, MDA, Concall, Investor Presentation, Shareholding, Screener screenshot, Technical chart, Other, Unknown/Requires Review).
> - SHA-256 based duplicate detection.
> - Page-preserving PDF/Image ingestion pipeline with scanned page detection.
> - **OCR Confidence & Status Architecture (CORRECTION APPLIED)**:
>   - `ocrStatus`: `'NOT_REQUIRED' | 'PENDING' | 'PROCESSING' | 'COMPLETE' | 'FAILED' | 'REQUIRES_REVIEW'`
>   - `ocrConfidence?: number` (undefined for machine-readable pages, never represented as 0% for unperformed OCR)
>   - `ocrConfidenceTier?: 'HIGH' | 'MEDIUM' | 'LOW' | 'NONE'`
>   - Machine-readable: `ocrStatus = 'NOT_REQUIRED'`, `ocrConfidence = undefined`
>   - High-confidence OCR (>90%): `ocrStatus = 'COMPLETE'`
>   - Medium-confidence OCR (80-90%): `ocrStatus = 'COMPLETE'`
>   - Low-confidence OCR (<80%): `ocrStatus = 'REQUIRES_REVIEW'`
>   - OCR failure: `ocrStatus = 'FAILED'`
> - Screenshot handling as first-class evidence (`SCREENSHOT_DERIVED` tag, dimension tracking).
> - Two-Year Annual Report Intake Audit (checks FY-1 and FY-0 presence, duplicate year warnings, company identity consistency).
> - Real-time terminal ingestion interface with drag-and-drop intake, queue monitor, and page-by-page inspector.
> - **CRITICAL**: No financial analysis, calculations, or downstream engines are executed in Phase 3.

